Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(mobile): pick several files on Android and read a
 content URI's size

- dialog.ShowFileOpenMultiple: several readers where the system picker allows it
  (Android, EXTRA_ALLOW_MULTIPLE + ClipData); elsewhere ShowFileOpen in a slice.
- androidURI.Size(): OpenableColumns.SIZE of a content:// URI, -1 when unknown.
  Callers ask with a type assertion on interface{ Size() int64 }.

